## 4. Instruction body behavior

| Situation | Body handling |
|-----------|----------------|
| No actions | Body appended to each `prompts[]` link, or creates one prompt if empty |
| Actions start with `$` that consumes prompts | Body prepended into `prompts[]` before first `$` |
| Other actions | Body merged with prompts after pipeline (compose / append per link) |
| Body-only `@ref` (no actions on target) | Body text appended to **each** input prompt link separately |

---

## 5. Changes array

Tuples: `(content_type, operation, data)`

| Field           | Values |
|----------------|--------|
| `content_type` | `prompt`, `text`, `image`, `sound`, `video`, `file`, … |
| `operation`    | `add`, `del`, `join` |
| `data`         | For `del`: link id to remove. For `add`: path or content. For `join`: `{sources, text}` |

After each step, the runtime applies pending `changes[]` and clears the array.

---

## 6. Externals (`$`)

Registered handlers (see `externals/__init__.py`):

| External | Role |
|----------|------|
| `$file`, `$folder` | Load file(s) from disk into arrays by extension |
| `$save` | Write array data to a path by extension |
| `$output` | Session output helper |
| `$image`, `$image2image`, `$image_variation` | Image generation |
| `$comfy` | ComfyUI workflow |
| `$llm` | LLM text generation |
| `$texts_to_prompts`, `$prompts_to_texts` | Convert between texts and prompts |
| `$music`, `$music_separation`, `$change_voice`, `$join_stems`, `$text2speech`, `$voice_enhance` | Music / stems / RVC / mix / TTS / Resemble Enhance |
| `$image_clip`, `$video_clip`, `$clip` | Video from images/sounds or joined videos + sound |
| `$image2video` | Image to video |
| `$sound2text` | Speech-to-text (optional JSON word timestamps) |
| `$draw_text` | Overlay multiline text on `images[]` (Pillow) |
| `$only` | Keep only listed arrays, e.g. `$only(images, prompts)` |
| `$select` | Pick elements by index, e.g. `$select(sounds=[1], texts=[0])` |
| `$check_image` | Image validation (may emit `del` changes) |
| `$clear` | Clear arrays |
| `$list`, `$first_image`, `$input_json` | Utilities |

**Prompt-consuming externals** (`$image`, `$llm`, `$music`, …) clear `prompts[]` on output after the call.

**Emulation (tests):** `AH_EMULATE_*=1`, `AH_EXTERNAL_INPROCESS=…`, `AH_EXTERNAL_SUBPROCESS=0`.

Each `$` call gets an op folder with `input.json`, `invoke.json`, and `output.json`.

---

## 7. Execution model

1. Parse `.ah` → `ParsedProgram` (`ahlib.ah_parser`).
2. Create session dir (`sessions/<timestamp>_<pid>_<suffix>/`).
3. Run entry `@` instruction with empty `ArrayBundle`.
4. Each `@` step: write `input.json`, run actions, apply changes, write `output.json`.
5. `@` instructions without `$` in their action tree may be **cached** by `(name, input links)`.

Implementation: `ahlib/ah_runtime.py`, action AST: `ahlib/ah_actions.py`.

